# 1. What is Slipshow

{pause}

{.block .center}
Slipshow is a new presentation software

{.grid children:slide}
----
{pause=list1}
---
# Infinite canvas

{#list1}
- You can place slides in the canvas (like this one) {pause}

- You can place slips in the canvas:

{.definition}
Slips are slides with no bound on the height. {pause}

- You can move and zoom on the canvas during the presentation. {pause}

{.block}
- You can visually represent the structure of your presentation.

- You can scroll by "half of a screen".

- It changes quite dramatically the way you prepare presentations.

{pause=aosl}
