# WYSIWYW

{#wysiwym}

> ### What You See Is What You Mean
>
> The rendering is automatic from a semantic description.

{pause}

> ### What You See Is What You Get
>
> The rendering is done by hand.

{pause}

> ### What You See Is What You Want
>
> You can choose between both.


